                <pb facs="0217" n="147" sameAs="frus:frus1862/pg147"/>

                <head>[Enclosures.]</head>
                <p>1. Earl Russell to Mr. Adams, July 4, 1862, for the date of the British demand
                    for restoration of recaptured vessels.</p>
                <p>2. Mr. Adams in reply to Lord Russell, July 1, 1862.</p>
                <p>3. Lord Russell to Mr. Adams, July 21, 1862, with copy of Lord Grenville’s note,
                    of October 21, 1799, to Mr. Liston, and Mr. Pickering’s note of May 3, 1800.</p>





